{
  "info": {
    "name": "XPAND · API (Flask)",
    "description": "Colección para probar la API del panel de catálogo XPAND.\n\nUso:\n1. Importa también el environment `XPAND.postman_environment.json` y selecciónalo (o usa las variables de la colección).\n2. Ejecuta **Auth › Login (coordinador)**. El script guarda el token JWT en la variable `token` automáticamente; el resto de requests ya lo usan.\n3. Para probar permisos de editor, ejecuta **Auth › Login (editor)**.\n\nBase: {{base_url}} (por defecto http://localhost:5000).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (coordinador)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const d = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (d.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', d.token);",
                  "  console.log('Token guardado para', d.user && d.user.correo);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"coordinador@xpand.co\",\n  \"password\": \"xpand2026\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (editor)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
